  "title": "Coast Guard rescues kite surfer near Vinoy Park, Fla.",
  "description": "Crew members aboard a 45-foot Response Boat-Medium from Station St. Petersburg rescue a 42-year-old male kite surfer Thursday, Aug. 30, 2018 in the entrance of the North Basin near Vinoy Park, Florida. The RBM boatcrew arrive on scene, transferred the man aboard, and transported him to Vinoy Marina in St. Petersburg, Florida with no injuries reported. (U.S. Coast Guard video by Seaman Zackary Mahan)",
